{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2040,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh, we are driving to a very strange location"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4780,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "somewhere I have never been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6460,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's because of the woman in the back seat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9340,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is Dianna, 'Physics Girl'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12340,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, uh, we are gonna go get a consultation, for something very special, right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18180,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is... look, I'm not gonna keep in suspense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20720,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Laser hair removal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22300,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We wanna talk about the science that makes laser hair removal work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26340,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I told him about this idea last, like, probably a year ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29940,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I was gonna do it in July or August"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33180,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've been waiting for this moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36840,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I'm scared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38200,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you're scared?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39800,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here we go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42840,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46700,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Aw, it stinks, man\n-It went directly into your nose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50000,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah it did"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50800,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's called a \"laser plume\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52020,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Laser plume? Is that the smoke that comes out?\n-It's actually a word for it. That's the smoke, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55660,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How was that shot?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67560,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The laser we are using has a wavelength of 1064 nanometers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71380,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning it is infrared radiation, invisible to the naked eye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78920,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But without an infrared filter, the camera's sensor picks up the laser pulses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82540,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which in my case were six at a time, each one lasting about one and a half miliseconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88040,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We dialed it up a little. We dialed it up just a tap though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91300,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Nice\n-Ready?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92200,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The laser will now deliver 25 joules of energy per square centimeter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96280,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was beautiful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97060,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ohhhhhh, wow!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100180,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we're talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104560,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, oh my God"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107620,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-That is insane\n-There's five bursts, did you see that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110660,
    "dDurationMs": 9040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it looks like, like, a shootout at the O.K. Corral. That's what that looks like. All the hairs are just getting, like, slaughtered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119920,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is amazing!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121460,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is an awesome shot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123860,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's really slick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135180,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had no idea that it was a shootout at the O.K. Corral!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139040,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That makes me really, kinda, reignites my excitement about my job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142880,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's awesome!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144240,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna get even closer on this next one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146320,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That'll be cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172240,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what's actually going on here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174820,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well dark eyes, skin, and hair contain a molecule called melanin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178860,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and melanin absorbs a wide range of wavelengths of light, especially in the ultraviolet part of the spectrum,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184300,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this makes it an ideal shield against the sun's harmful rays, which is why you get a tan when you go out in the sun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190440,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's your body producing and releasing more melanin in the skin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194380,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, the idea with laser hair removal is to get the melanin in dark hairs to absorb the laser light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200280,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without the skin around it absorbing much of that energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203000,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, it actually works best if you have really dark hairs and light skin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207840,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Infrared lasers are commonly used because melanin absorbs in this part of the spectrum"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212040,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more than other common molecules in the skin like water and oxyhemoglobin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216200,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Red lasers, at 755nm, are also often used for the same reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220900,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As the melanin absorbs the laser energy, the hair heats up to well over 100 degrees Celsius,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226240,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "causing it to burn and vaporizing the water it contains,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229720,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this puffs the hair up a little bit like a cheeto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232720,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's that expanding water vapor. Looking closely at this shot, you can actually see the bubbles on the hair"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238200,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the vaporization of water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240560,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, the objective is not to destroy the hair, it's to actually use the hair to destroy the germ cells"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246940,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the follicle that produce the hair in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250180,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, it's kind of like using the hair to kill the hair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254240,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This image shows a cross section of three hair follicles following a laser hair removal treatment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259460,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The one in the middle contained little melanin, and therefore, shows no damage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262840,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other two show the hair shaft has been destroyed, rupturing the inner root sheath"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267860,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and damaging the outer root sheath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270140,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cells suffer damage when their temperature rises above 60 degrees Celsius."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273780,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is because at that temperature, the bonds in proteins and collagen molecules start breaking apart,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279740,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's a process known as denaturation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281800,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, the hotter it is and the longer that temperature is maintained, the more denaturation occurs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286800,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the higher the likelihood that that cell will die."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289360,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if you cause enough damage to the cells in the follicle that make the hair,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294160,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the hair will never grow back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296080,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is the goal of laser hair removal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298600,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This sequence of ultrashort pulses is used to ensure that the heat doesn't spread too far"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303880,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the region surrounding the hair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306120,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, the idea is the hair heats up, damages the germ cells right next to it, but then the laser light turns off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311440,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before that heat can spread too much further, and then you hit the hair with another very short pulse again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316500,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you were instead just to keep heating the hair, it would heat not only the germ cells around it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321640,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also your skin that you don't want to damage, and you would end up with burns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325880,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, that's the reason for the series of pulses that we saw."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329740,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, if you think about it, this is kind of a weird irony."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333160,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean melanin is a molecule meant to protect us, meant to protect our skin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337500,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from harsh rays of sunlight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339420,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's why it absorbs that light before it can penetrate further into your body and do damage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343460,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now with laser hair removal, we're using melanin - it's unique absorption powers - against it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349520,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By overpowering it with lots of laser energy, we get it to heat up the hair to such high temperatures that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355880,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the hair kills the neighboring cells, the germ cells in the follicle that produce the hair ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361220,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, we are using melanin's powers against it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365800,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Normally before a laser hair removal procedure, the hair is shaved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369600,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that serves a few purposes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371140,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For one thing, not too much energy goes into burning the external hair, which does you no good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375780,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the first place, and, second, it prevents the hot hair from landing on the skin and causing surface burns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380100,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we found that shaved patches were less interesting to watch, because you can't really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383320,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see what's happening under the skin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385840,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After the creation of the first working laser, in 1960, it's inventor, Theodore Maiman,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391540,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called it, \"a solution looking for a problem.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394300,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An unwanted hair may just be that problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397080,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because laser hair removal is the most requested cosmetic procedure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404060,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, I have a lot of people to thank, who made this video possible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407960,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Diana, \"Physics Girl,\" whose idea this was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410700,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks to her, I no longer have that strange patch of hair in my shoulders."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414920,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you should really go check out her channel, Physics Girl."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417340,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, I also wanna thank Darren. Without him at BeyondSlowMotion, we would never have been able to do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422660,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was simply amazing, so you should also check out BeyondSlowMotion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427100,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, of course, I want to thank Audible, the leading audio book provider with hundreds of thousands of titles in all areas of literture including fiction, nonfiction, and periodicals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435520,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whenever I'm out, I'm on the go, and I can't really watch videos, like when I'm driving, then I listen to Audible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440740,
    "dDurationMs": 6940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also listen to Audible when I'm on the plane, and I'm about to get on a plane right now and fly to Svalbard, Norway, which is nearly the North Pole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448040,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is gonna be a very long flight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450680,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I will definitely be listening to, uh, my audio books. In fact, the audio book I'm listening to at the moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455860,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is called Creativity, inc. And I am learning a lot from this book about how to be a creative person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462120,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how to be productive, and it's a great book to listen to because it's a story told by Ed Catmull, and you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468140,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of feel like he's there with you, telling you this story of how Pixar was founded and how they made creativity work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474520,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I'm loving that book. If you wanna check it out, you can actually download it for free, or you can get a free 30-day trial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481520,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by going to audible.com/Veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483120,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, one of the reasons Audible keeps supporting Veritasium is because they know that the people who watch this channel like learning things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489540,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and another way to learn things, besides youtube, is to listen to audiobooks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492740,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I highly recommend you give 'em a try, for a 30-day free trial. If you wanna do that go to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496140,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "audible.com/Veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498520,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
